-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",20,{
[609]="70000069\n1\tBring the tarnished armour to Brúni\tBrúni Stonehelm can be found among the armour merchants of Thorin's Hall, where the canal runs through the mountain. Halli asks you to take his brother's armour to Brúni Stonehelm.\n2\tTalk to Geitir\030Talk to Óláfr\tIn return for polishing Halli's armour, Brúni asks you to collect the damaged armour from the guards at Noglond, the way-station south of Thorin's Hall.\n3\tDeliver the dented armour to Brúni\tBrúni is by the armour merchants in Thorin's Hall. You should take the armour you collected to Brúni to be mended.\n4\tReturn the polished armour to Halli\tHalli is in Frerin's Court, south of Thorin's Hall. Brúni has given you Halli's armour, cleaned and polished, to return to its owner.\n",
[610]="70067EAB\n1\tTalk to Anyâmat\tAnyâmat has worked hard to write new verses for a shanty and would love to show them off to you. Talk to Anyâmat in Halrax.\n",
[611]="700715AA\n1\tSpeak with Elder Jangâli in Sen Chatâk\tSpeak with Elder Jangâli in Sen Chatâk. Sen Chatâk can be found in Kighân to the north of the city of Zajâna, within Mûr Ghala.\n",
[612]="70040143\n1\tCollect Míreth's doll (quantity: see journal)\030Collect Míreth's book (quantity: see journal)\030Collect wildflowers (total: 4)\tMíreth's doll and book can be found in her bedroom. The flowers can be collected outside the house. You should collect everything Míreth asked for.\n2\tBring the items to Míreth\tMíreth is in her father's home in northern Lamedon. You should bring everything you gathered to Míreth.\n3\tBring Míreth's gifts to Fuirion\tFuirion is in Gladion's home in northern Lamedon. You should bring Míreth's gift to Fuirion.\n",
[613]="7006C566\n1\tLet Malgat complete his work\tMalgat offered to provide you a gift. You only need wait a little while for him to finish his work. Adventure elsewhere for a few minutes and then return to him in Jirush.\n2\tReturn to Malgat at his home in Jirush to receive his gift\tEnough time has passed. Malgat is likely done with the work on your gift. Make your way to his location in Jirush to claim your gift.\n",
[614]="7006C533\n1\tCollect the Eldest of Samarsûg's corpse\030Collect Shûzhuz's corpse\030Collect Girgazug's corpse\tMalgat asked you to recover the corpse of the Eldest of Samarsûg in the marshes in northern Khûd Zagin, the corpse of Shûhuz from a den west of Jirush, and the corpse of Grigazug from the ruined temple Is Dara west of Jirush.\n2\tReturn to Malgat with the corpses of the slain beasts\tYou defeated the Eldest of Samarsûg, the jackal Shûhuz, and the scorpion Girgazug. You collected their corpses, as Malgat requested. Return to Malgat and give him the corpses.\n",
[615]="7002EF2C\n1\tCollect Frána's pillow\030Collect Frána's cloak\030Collect Frána's robe\tSome of Frána's comforts may yet be found near the Mead Hall of Thornhope. Frána has rudely commanded you to find any of his comforts which may have survived the Orcs' attack and bring them back to him.\n2\tBring the items you found to Frána outside of Thornhope\tFrána is encamped outside the walls of Thornhope. You should bring the items you found to Frána.\n",
[616]="70020DBA\n1\tCollect expert pipe-weed seeds (total: 10)\tExpert pipe-weed seeds can be purchased in the Shire. Rhus Cornchúthur has suggested that bringing him something of importance related to pipe-weed might earn you the trust of the Stoors of Enedwaith. Perhaps a supply of pipe-weed seeds from the Shire will appease him.\n2\tTalk to Rhus Cornchúthur in the Gloomglens\tRhus Cornchúthur is outside Maur Tulhau in the Gloomglens of Enedwaith. You should bring the Longbottom Leaf seeds to Rhus Cornchúthur.\n",
[617]="70056F66\n1\tHelp Imák unpack his belongings\tImák has asked you to help him unpack some of the belongings he brought with him from Skarháld.\n2\tOpen the small coffer\tA small coffer among Imák's belongings has drawn your attention.\n3\tTalk to Imák at your camp-site in Misthallow\tImák is very cross with you.\n4\tImák says he can smell wargs prowling about to the south-east, and the bristly Stout-axe has sent you to slay one or more of the creatures before they attain the numbers to brave your camp-site.\t\n5\tTalk to Imák at your camp-site in Misthallow\tImák is at your camp-site in Misthallow.\n6\tEat in silence, leaving Imák to his thoughts\tImák has fallen silent, and perhaps you should eat in silence and leave him be for a time.\n7\tTalk to Glóin at your camp-site in Misthallow\030Talk to Venko at your camp-site in Misthallow\tGlóin and Venko are at your camp-site in Misthallow.\n",
[618]="7002B60C\n1\tFind Ernwyd Bolger and persuade him to return to work\030Find Opalessa Sandheaver and persuade her to return to work\030Find Alric Hornblower and persuade him to return to work\tThe other vendors can be found throughout the Farmers Faire and Bywater area. Ernwyd Bolger was last seen drinking copious quantities of beer. Opalessa Sandheaver is said to be very fond of dancing. Alric Hornblower is rumoured to have a bit of an unhealthy obsession with mushrooms. You should scold the market vendors who shirked their duties to play at the Faire.\n2\tReturn to Daisy Sandyman\tDaisy Sandyman awaits you at the market stall in the Farmers Faire of Bywater. You should return to Daisy Sandyman and inform her that a customer has been helped.\n",
[619]="7006753D\n1\tHunt beetles in Ghax-hophra for shells (total: 10)\tMuzmák has asked you to hunt beetles in Ghax-hophra for beetle shells. Ghax-hophra can be found north of Kafagur.\n2\tTalk to Muzmák at Kafagur\tYou've collected a wide variety of colourful beetle shells. You should bring them back to Muzmák at Kafagur.\n",
[620]="70062AA7\n1\tCollect feathers from crebain near the Old South Road (total: 8)\tCrebain hassle travellers on the Old South Road, north of Mossward, and Bevan believes their feathers might be put to a number of uses.\n2\tBring the craban feathers to Bevan at the north gate of Mossward\tBevan is at the north gate of Mossward, waiting for you to return with the craban feathers for which he asked.\n",
[621]="70062E85\n1\tDefeat the wight-lord Bregach in Dol Ernil\030Defeat the wight-lord Daethos in Dol Ernil\tTwo powerful wight-lords, Bregach and Daethos, now lurk somewhere within Dol Ernil, in Tyrn Gorthad.\n2\tTalk to Ranger Faradan south-west of Calarphel in Tyrn Gorthad\tRanger Faradan is south-west of Calarphel in Tyrn Gorthad.\n",
[622]="700551D4\n1\tBurn twisted-pale roots in the Garth of Angáth\tTwisted pale-roots can be found in the Garth of Angáth in the Circle of Despair.\n2\tBurn twisted-pale roots in the Garth of Angáth (total: 12)\tTwisted pale-roots can be found in the Garth of Angáth in the Circle of Despair. You have encountered twisted pale-roots in the Garth of Angáth and should burn them, lest their corruption linger in Minas Morgul.\n",
[623]="70067F53\n1\tDefeat wights near the Mâkhda Khorbo (total: 10)\030Defeat spirits near the Mâkhda Khorbo (total: 5)\030Defeat decayed near the Mâkhda Khorbo (total: 3)\tKhûtra Elder Roshat has asked for your help culling the rising population of the dead near the Mâkhda Khorbo. The ruins of the Mâkhda Khorbo can be found in the hills to the east of Khûtra.\n2\tReturn to Elder Roshat in Khûtra\tReturn to Elder Roshat in Khûtra.\n",
[624]="700604A9\n1\tTalk to Ravaedron and help him say good-bye to his friends\tRavaedron stands outside Fernbrake Cot, steeling himself for a sad parting.\n2\tTalk to Ravaedron outside Fernbrake Cot\tRavaedron stands outside Fernbrake Cot, confused and unsatisfied.\n",
[625]="7002C89F\n1\tCollect hides from beasts (total: 10)\tHides can be found on the bears and deer of Thinglad. You should collect hides from beasts you encounter to use as a gift for the Rohirrim.\n2\tBring the hides to Renfaer\tRenfaer is near the centre of Thinglad. You should bring the hides you gathered to Renfaer.\n",
[626]="700037FD\n1\tSeal the fissure with Tindr's mortar (total: 3)\030Collect Mortar\tEnter Thorin's Hall to the north, then go west to the Hall of Merchants. Tindr gave you some mortar with which to repair the cracks in the canal walls.\n2\tTalk to Tindr\tTindr is in the courtyard outside Thorin's Hall. The fissure was sealed. You should return to Tindr with news of your success.\n",
[627]="70028C80\n1\tPatrol the first rally point\030Patrol the second rally point\030Patrol the third rally point\tThe patrol path runs through the valley west of Forthbrond. Ardwyn has asked you to patrol several points for signs of the Dunlendings.\n2\tTalk to Ardwyn at Forthbrond\tArdwyn is at Forthbrond, east of the valley. You should report what you have seen to Ardwyn.\n",
[628]="700442B9\n1\tDefeat Nardaga\030Defeat Krumab\tOrc Captains can be found within the port of the Harlond. You should defeat Orc Captains within the port of the Harlond.\n",
[629]="700442BA\n1\tDefeat Orcs within the Harlond (total: 12)\tOrcs can be found within the Harlond. You should defeat Orcs within the Harlond.\n",
[630]="700442BE\n1\tDestroy siege engines (total: 8)\tOrkish siege engines can be found in the Harlond. You should destroy these siege engines before the Rammas is toppled by the Orkish forces gathered in the Harlond.\n",
[631]="700442BD\n1\tDestroy Orc tents (total: 10)\tOrc tents can be found around the port of Harlond. You should destroy Orc tents in Harlond.\n",
[632]="700442BC\n1\tDefeat trolls in the Harlond (total: 6)\tTrolls can be found in the port of the Harlond. You should defeat trolls within the port of the Harlond.\n",
[633]="7004CE8D\n1\tSalute Dale merchants (total: 4)\030Calm angry shoppers (total: 4)\030Congratulate happy shoppers (total: 4)\030Assist indecisive shoppers (total: 4)\030Visit the Upper Markets, north\030Visit the Upper Markets, south\030Visit the Jolly Bell tavern\030Visit the Lower Markets, west\030Visit the Lower Markets, central\030Visit the Lower Markets, south\tYou should visit and be seen at the various market areas and tavern in Dale, salute merchants, congratulate happy shoppers, assist indecisive shoppers, and calm angry shoppers on the way.\n2\tReturn to Rótha\tYou should return to Rótha, who can be found inside the Great-keep in Dale.\n",
[634]="7002727E\n1\tScout the Mustering Tree\tThe Mustering Tree lies to the north-west of the Rohirrim scout-camp. Saeradan asked you to scout to locations for clues regarding the evil in the Gravenwood.\n2\tScout the Tree of Tribute\tThe Tree of Tribute lies almost due south of the Mustering Tree, south-west of the Rohirrim scout-camp. Saeradan wants you to scout two locations for clues regarding the evil in the Gravenwood.\n",
[635]="7006BF40\n1\tGather Sarláshi shoots from Róthirin (total: 12)\tGather Sarláshi shoots from the grove of Róthirin. Róthirin is located east of Vartúlin.\n2\tPlant Sarláshi shoots in Vartúlin (total: 12)\tReturn to Vartúlin and plant the Sarláshi shoots at well-lit spots around Vartúlin.\n3\tSpeak with Thórvilon in Vartúlin\tSpeak with Thórvilon in Vartúlin.\n",
[636]="7001AECC\n1\tRead the first grave-stone\tThe graveyard of Audaghaim can be found south of the Haunted Inn in the Dourstocks. Idhrenfair has asked you to search for any clues as to the history of Audaghaim in the town's graveyard.\n2\tRead the second grave-stone\tThe graveyard of Audaghaim can be found south of the Haunted Inn in the Dourstocks. Idhrenfair has asked you to search for any clues as to the history of Audaghaim in the town's graveyard.\n3\tRead the third grave-stone\tThe graveyard of Audaghaim can be found south of the Haunted Inn in the Dourstocks. Idhrenfair has asked you to search for any clues as to the history of Audaghaim in the town's graveyard.\n4\tRead the fourth grave-stone\tThe graveyard of Audaghaim can be found south of the Haunted Inn in the Dourstocks. Idhrenfair has asked you to search for any clues as to the history of Audaghaim in the town's graveyard.\n5\tRead the fifth grave-stone\tThe graveyard of Audaghaim can be found south of the Haunted Inn in the Dourstocks. Idhrenfair has asked you to search for any clues as to the history of Audaghaim in the town's graveyard.\n6\tTalk to Idhrenfair at the Haunted Inn\tThe Haunted Inn can be found north of the graveyard of Audaghaim in the Dourstocks. You should return to Idhrenfair with your discoveries.\n",
[637]="70068415\n1\tCollect buffalo hides ([see journal]/12)\030Collect buffalo haunches ([see journal]/12)\t\n2\tKhânai at the expedition camp desires more buffalo haunches and hides. Her patron in Umbar City sees an increase in the value of the beast and wants more to maximize their profit.\t\n",
[638]="700681C2\n1\tFind Etinan's necklace\tEtinan has asked you to find the necklace his partner gave him on the beach of Baj Khatûg. Baj Khatûg is an island off the eastern shore of Zamarzîr.\n2\tTalk to Etinan\tYou have found the necklace and should return it to Etinan. Etinan can be found in Halrax.\n",
[639]="700453E8\n1\tCollect hides from Orcs in Taur Drúadan (total: 10)\tSome Orcs in Taur Drúadan may be carrying hides. You should take hides from Orcs in Taur Drúadan.\n2\tRepair broken drums (total: 6)\tBroken drums can be found in Drû Bhûta. You should fix some broken drums.\n3\tSpeak with Dhûn-buri-Ghôb\tDhûn-buri-Ghôb can be found in Drû Bhûta. You should speak with Dhûn-buri-Ghôb.\n",
[640]="70001131\n1\tFind the white marker stone indicating the path to Thorenhad\tArrod is encamped in the Bruinen Gorges, upon the cliff overlooking the road eastward from Narlinn's camp. Narlinn told you to seek the white marker stone pointing towards the road north to Thorenhad, then take the road and turn aside to the right of the path and circle back to the cliff. Narlinn has not received any reports from her friend Arrod in days and has asked you to seek him out and learn if he is well.\n2\tTalk to Arrod\tArrod is encamped in the Bruinen Gorges, upon the cliff overlooking the road eastward from Narlinn's camp. Narlinn told you to seek the white marker stone pointing towards the road north to Thorenhad, then take the road and turn aside to the right of the path and circle back to the cliff. Narlinn has not received any reports from her friend Arrod in days and has asked you to seek him out and learn if he is well.\n3\tSearch hendroval-nest\tThe hendroval made its nest among the rocks to the east of Arrod's post. Fearing for his bird, Caledhroval, Arrod has asked you to search the nest of the hendroval he saw for any evidence of what it might have brought back from its hunt.\n4\tBring the brightly-coloured feather to Arrod\tArrod is encamped in the Bruinen Gorges, upon the cliff overlooking the eastward road, west of the hendroval-nest. You should bring the feather you found to Arrod.\n",
})
